  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to enhance womens and youths meaningful participation in peacebuilding in Bangsamoro by strengthening institutional and community capacities. It focuses on implementing the Women, Peace, and Security (WPS) agenda, supporting women mediators, former combatants, and women affected by extremism. The project provides technical support, promotes peace mediation, and assists in establishing womens committees and education programs. It also integrates UNSCR 1325 resolutions into reg</narrative>
  </description>
